<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">GOOD FOOD · GOOD DAYS</view><view class="row between"><view class="pill">{{space}}</view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="muted">处理中…</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warning error">{{error}}</view><view class="title">整理一道好菜</view><view class="warning">确认食材、用量和步骤后再保存。视频未说明的用量请留空。</view><view class="card"><view class="label">菜名</view><input value="{{form.title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="formField" placeholder="例如：番茄炒蛋"/><view class="label">基础人数</view><input type="digit" value="{{form.servings}}" data-field="servings" bindinput="formField"/><view class="label">原作者</view><input value="{{form.author}}" data-field="author" bindinput="formField"/><view class="label">来源链接</view><input value="{{form.source}}" data-field="source" bindinput="formField"/><view class="label">标签（空格分隔）</view><input value="{{form.tags}}" data-field="tags" bindinput="formField"/></view><view class="heading">食材与调料</view><view wx:for="{{form.ingredients}}" wx:key="index" class="card"><view class="row"><input class="grow" placeholder="食材" value="{{item.name}}" data-type="ingredients" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="name" bindinput="lineField"/><input class="small" placeholder="用量" value="{{item.quantity}}" data-type="ingredients" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="quantity" bindinput="lineField"/><input class="small" placeholder="单位" value="{{item.unit}}" data-type="ingredients" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="unit" bindinput="lineField"/></view><view class="actions"><button class="ghost" data-type="ingredients" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeLine">移除</button></view></view><button bindtap="addIngredient">＋ 添加食材</button><view class="heading">操作步骤</view><view wx:for="{{form.steps}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="step-number">STEP {{index+1}}</view><textarea value="{{item.text}}" placeholder="写清楚操作、火候和用量" data-type="steps" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="text" bindinput="lineField"/><image wx:if="{{item.image}}" src="{{item.image}}" mode="widthFix" class="step-image"/><view class="label">本步骤计时（秒，0 表示不计时）</view><input type="number" value="{{item.seconds}}" data-type="steps" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="seconds" bindinput="lineField"/><view class="actions"><button bindtap="chooseImage" data-index="{{index}}">添加步骤图</button><button class="ghost" data-type="steps" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeLine">移除步骤</button></view></view><button bindtap="addStep">＋ 添加步骤</button><view class="card"><view class="label">口味与制作备注</view><textarea value="{{form.notes}}" data-field="notes" bindinput="formField"/></view><button class="primary wide" id="action-saveRecipe" bindtap="saveRecipe" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认并保存菜谱</button></view>